  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "牛顿/千克. **故槽中水的重量即为**$P=9.8$牛顿/千克$\\times80000$千",
        "克$\\approx800000$牛顿. **水就以这样大的力压槽底**."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把水的重量除以槽底的面积即得压强$p$："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$p=\\frac{800000\\text{牛顿}}{16\\text{米}^2}=50000$牛顿/米$^2=50000$帕斯卡",
        "$=50$千帕斯卡."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "实际上，液体对容器底的压强可以用一个很简单的公式",
        "来计算. 为了导出这个公式，我们再转回去研究刚才的问题，",
        "只是这次我们用一般的形式来求解."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把容器中液柱的高度用字母$h$表示，液体的密度用$\\rho$表",
        "示，而容器的底面积用$S$表示."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "液柱的体积$V=Sh$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "液体的质量$m=\\rho V$，或$m=\\rho Sh$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "液体的重量$P=gm$，或$P=g\\rho Sh$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由于液柱的重量等于液体对容器底的压力，故将重量$P$",
        "除以面积$S$，就得到压强$p$："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$p=\\frac{P}{S}$，或$p=\\frac{g\\rho Sh}{S}$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "即 $p=g\\rho h$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这样，我们就得到了计算液体对容器底的压强的公式. 由",
        "这个公式可以看出，**液体对容器底的压强与液体的密度及液",
        "柱的高度成正比**."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据这个公式也可以计算液体对容器壁的压强及液体内",
        "部的压强，方向向上的压强也包括在内. 这是因为在同一深",
        "度处向各方向的压强都相等."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
